\"tv\",\"_score\":0.411764705882353,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":4,\"seasonName\":\"Season 4\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Twenty drivers — some veterans, some rookies — compete in another drama-filled and adrenaline-fueled season of Formula 1 racing.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qQizhidwKP2WLJEokpKysYlSRoo.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Clash of the Titans\",\"overview\":\"The 2021 Formula 1 season begins at the Bahrain Grand Prix, where drivers give it everything to take the first checkered flag of the year.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pxa0A5MBRKnMSuS8uPv96QNbcYo.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":15,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Ace in the Hole\",\"overview\":\"Now racing for McLaren, Daniel Ricciardo sets out to prove that he's still a force on the track. Meanwhile, teammate Lando Norris puts on the pressure.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/da0rQvhwFlA4z6bZAmFkHkFdeBR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Tipping Point\",\"overview\":\"Red Bull's Max Verstappen pulls off a string of victories. Lewis Hamilton of Mercedes struggles to keep pace. Later, an accident leads to controversy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ApOGJNyBRx1EAOUxNNlSx9xqalo.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"A Mountain to Climb\",\"overview\":\"The Haas team looks to reverse its recent fortunes with a new sponsor and two rookie drivers: Nikita Mazepin and Mick Schumacher.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mVKRjAC9KH9BBVhRl5DZsLYq16I.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Staying Alive\",\"overview\":\"Down but never out, McLaren's Ricciardo goes pedal to the metal in hopes of ruining Ferrari's homecoming at the Italian Grand Prix.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8goreAEbqIkBv0fUVq7cLuCSe5W.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":34},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"A Point to Prove\",\"overview\":\"With Williams Racing under new leadership, the storied team looks to put its recent troubles in the rearview mirror and return to greatness.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ikTVPFzOZSUcE7IKAfhxc007q3A.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Growing Pains\",\"overview\":\"They have the raw talent, but can they handle the pressure? Now Yuki Tsunoda and Esteban Ocon must sink or swim in the rough waters of Formula 1.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5YVaZfp0IT9fkOl80xpKuJC7rAh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Dances with Wolff\",\"overview\":\"Rumors fly about whether an up-and-coming driver will join Hamilton on team Mercedes, potentially leaving Valtteri Bottas without a seat.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vyhRqKMo3ssjhASROKL1gMkVGsS.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Gloves Are Off\",\"overview\":\"Only a few races remain, and for drivers desperate for any advantage they can get their hands on, the gloves are officially off.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9msZt0ogBWClH3Gjsm6BM0sDJRc.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Hard Racing\",\"overview\":\"As another fierce season comes to a close, Mercedes and Red Bull face off in what may be the biggest winner-takes-all race of a generation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/66at0cexmAABkMO3g7Swpfb0cFj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":11,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-11\",\"runtime\":46}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-03-08\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":